[I] A portable C FFI for Lua 5.1+

[T] cffi-lua is a portable C foreign function interface for Lua based on
[T] libffi, written from scratch and aiming to be mostly compatible with the
[T] LuaJIT FFI. Thanks to libffi it works on many operating systems and CPU
[T] architectures.

[U] https://github.com/q66/cffi-lua

